<title>USA: Todhunter sees Q3 and Q4 better than Q2.</title>
<headline>Todhunter sees Q3 and Q4 better than Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Todhunter International Inc said Monday it expects sales and earnings to strengthen during the third and fourth quarters.</p>
<p>The company said its second quarter was weaker than expected.</p>
<p>It said its lower sales resulted from decreased shipments of bulk alcohol products and a decrease in contract bottling.</p>
<p>Lower shipments of bulk products were due to softness in export shipments of alcohol and a decrease in shipments of wine, it said.</p>
</text>
